    <h1 id="market-hero-title" class="text-on-surface">China Market<br><span class="text-secondary">Insights</span></h1>
    <p class="lux-page-hero-subtitle lux-hero-support">China is one of the world's major production, trade, innovation and consumer markets. Understanding the Chinese market requires looking beyond national scale to cities, economic centres, trade relations and specific industries.</p>
  </div>
